# The story map (docs/ROADMAP.md, "Tools track"), through the real keys: off the
# STORY tab, the whole story over this seed; closer in, a station lists its beats;
# a pan measured; tab walks the story in order and the rest dims; x narrows to
# the chosen beat's arc; m turns it to ORDER, the arcs as lanes in story order;
# e opens the chosen beat's arc as a graph, and esc comes back to the map.
#   tools/tour.sh tours/story-map.tour --seed=7 --hour=11 --weather=clear:0 --dev=story --stats
coast calm
wait 1.0

# `--dev=story` stands the app up on the STORY tab; the map is its first row.
await app:dev 20
# The same span on the STORY tab's list first: what the world behind the slate
# costs on this machine now, so the map's pan below is read against it.
perf stats begin
wait 2.5
perf stats end story-tab-baseline
choose story_map
tap use
await story_map 5
wait 0.4
shot 01-the-whole-story with app:dev

# --- closer in, and a pan on the real keys, measured ----------------------------------
tap zoom_in
wait 0.2
tap zoom_in
wait 0.2
tap zoom_in
wait 0.3
shot 02-closer with app:dev
perf stats begin
press move_right 1.5
press move_down 1.0
perf stats end story-map-pan raw

# --- the scrub: tab walks the story in order ------------------------------------------------
tap inventory
wait 0.1
tap inventory
wait 0.1
tap inventory
wait 0.1
tap inventory
wait 0.1
tap inventory
await story_map:chosen 2
wait 0.3
shot 03-scrubbed-five-in with app:dev

# --- narrowed to the chosen beat's arc ---------------------------------------------------------
tap drop
await story_map:narrow 2
wait 0.3
shot 04-one-arc with app:dev
tap drop
tap drop
tap drop
wait 0.2

# --- ORDER: the whole game's interleaving at once ---------------------------------------------
tap map
await story_map:order 2
wait 0.3
shot 05-order with app:dev
tap zoom_out
tap zoom_out
tap zoom_out
tap map
wait 0.3
shot 06-back-to-the-world with app:dev

# --- e: the chosen beat's arc as a graph, walked a node on, and back ------------------------
tap use
await story_arc 2
wait 0.3
shot 07-the-arc-as-a-graph with app:dev
tap inventory
wait 0.1
tap inventory
wait 0.3
shot 08-two-nodes-on with app:dev
tap pause
await story_map 2
wait 0.2
tap pause
wait 0.2
tap dev_toggle
await app:none 5
